Subject: [PATCH] Restore the Windows CJK font fallback order

Port the five locale fallback lists from qtbase_5.15.19's
0003-fix-windows-font-fallback.patch at patches commit
f7433965ed33996c641a822c78a81eef3526c9e7. Apply after 0027 so Windows 7
also tries Meiryo and the non-UI Chinese families when newer fonts are absent.

diff --git a/src/gui/text/windows/qwindowsfontdatabasebase.cpp b/src/gui/text/windows/qwindowsfontdatabasebase.cpp
index 7c59a01..9ead33a 100644
--- a/src/gui/text/windows/qwindowsfontdatabasebase.cpp
+++ b/src/gui/text/windows/qwindowsfontdatabasebase.cpp
@@ -975,55 +975,74 @@ QString QWindowsFontDatabaseBase::familyForStyleHint(QFont::StyleHint styleHint)
 static const char *other_tryFonts[] = {
     "Arial",
     "Yu Gothic UI",
-    "MS UI Gothic",
